{"speciesId":294,"names":{"fr":"Ramboum","es":"Loudred","en":"Loudred","ja":"ドゴーム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LOUDRED’s bellowing can completely decimate a wood-frame house. It uses its voice to punish its foes. This POKéMON’s round ears serve as loudspeakers."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LOUDRED shouts while stamping its feet. After it finishes shouting, this POKéMON becomes incapable of hearing anything for a while. This is considered to be a weak point."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It positions the round speakers on its head to assail foes with ultrasonic waves at massive volume. It builds power by stomping the ground."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"When it stamps its feet and bellows, it generates ultrasonic waves that can blow apart a house."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When it stamps its feet and bellows, it generates ultrasonic waves that can blow apart a house."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It shouts loudly by inhaling air, and then uses its well-developed stomach muscles to exhale."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It shouts loudly by inhaling air, and then uses its well-developed stomach muscles to exhale."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"L’onde de choc provoquée par son cri peut renverser un camion. Il trépigne pour augmenter sa force."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"L’onde de choc provoquée par son cri peut renverser un camion. Il trépigne pour augmenter sa force."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Grâce à ses puissants muscles abdominaux, il peut crier en expulsant l’air qu’il avait aspiré."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Aspira profundamente y luego, usando sus fuertes abdominales, suelta un potente vozarrón."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It shouts loudly by inhaling air, and then uses its well-developed stomach muscles to exhale."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"思い切り 吸いこんだ 空気を 発達した 腹筋を 使って 吐き出すことで 大声を 出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"L’onde de choc provoquée par son cri peut renverser un camion. Il trépigne pour augmenter sa force."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Las ondas de sus gritos pueden voltear un camión. Patea el suelo para ganar potencia."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大声の 衝撃波で トラックを ひっくりかえしてしまう。 足を 踏みならして パワーアップ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le hurlement de Ramboum est si fort qu’il peut faire s’effondrer une petite maison en bois. Il se sert de sa voix pour punir ses ennemis. Les oreilles rondes de ce Pokémon servent de haut-parleurs."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Los bramidos de Loudred pueden echar abajo una casa reforzada con vigas de madera. Este Pokémon usa el vozarrón que tiene para castigar a sus rivales. Las orejas redondas le sirven de altavoces."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Loudred’s bellowing can completely decimate a wood-frame house. It uses its voice to punish its foes. This Pokémon’s round ears serve as loudspeakers."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"木造の 家を コナゴナに 吹き飛ばすほどの 大声を 出して 相手を 痛めつける。 丸い 耳が スピーカーの 働きを する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ramboum hurle en trépignant. Quand il a fini de hurler, ce Pokémon reste incapable d’entendre le moindre son pendant un long moment. Il semble que ce soit son point faible."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Loudred grita a la vez que da pisotones. Una vez que deja de chillar, se queda ensordecido durante un buen rato; lo que se considera su punto débil."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Loudred shouts while stamping its feet. After it finishes shouting, this Pokémon becomes incapable of hearing anything for a while. This is considered to be a weak point."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"足を 踏み鳴らしながら 大声を 出す。 大声を 出した後は しばらくの 間 なにも 聞こえなくなってしまうのが 弱点。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses oreilles lui servant de haut-parleurs peuvent émettre des ondes sonores dont la puissance suffit à balayer une maison."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"A través de las orejas, que le sirven de altavoces, emite ondas sonoras capaces de echar abajo una casa."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Loudred’s ears serve as speakers, and they can put out sound waves powerful enough to blow away a house."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"耳は スピーカーの 役割。 一軒家を 吹きとばす 威力の 音波を 耳から 放射する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses hurlements n’affectent pas seulement l’ouïe ; ils provoquent aussi une onde de choc qui balaie les ennemis et leur inflige des dégâts."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su voz no afecta solo al oído. Sus ondas sonoras provocan variaciones de presión en el aire que hacen que sus enemigos salgan despedidos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The force o